Before we do that, can you please post a summary of the transpiler and its proof to claude-4 covering the following points:

1. which Python source revision it translates;
2. where the current startup failure is;
3. how many runtime gaps it knows of, or how it would list them in advance;
4. whether anyone has timed a translated module against Python.
5. How much of it is verified in the current proof effort (estimate OK)
